# FlowBoard — Project Summary

**Type:** SaaS Project Management Tool (Linear/Notion inspired)  
**Developer:** Solo full-stack (Tejas)  
**Status:** Pre-deployment (as of June 2026)

---

## Tech Stack

### Backend
| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Runtime | Node.js + TypeScript |
| Framework | Express.js |
| ORM | Prisma |
| Database | PostgreSQL |
| Cache | Redis (ioredis) |
| Auth | JWT (httpOnly cookies) + Google OAuth (Firebase) + GitHub OAuth |
| Real-time | Socket.io |
| Queue | BullMQ |
| File Storage | Cloudinary |
| Email | Resend |
| Infra | Docker + Docker Compose |

### Frontend
| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Framework | React 18 + TypeScript + Vite |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS v4 + shadcn/ui |
| State (server) | TanStack Query v5 |
| State (client) | Redux Toolkit |
| Forms | React Hook Form + Zod |
| HTTP | Axios (with interceptor + refresh token queue) |
| Routing | React Router v6 |
| Drag & Drop | @dnd-kit/core |
| Real-time | Socket.io-client |
| Notifications | Sonner (toast) |

---

