## Bugs Fixed During Development

| Bug | Fix |
|-----|-----|
| `mutate` vs `mutateAsync` — RHF `isSubmitting` not tracking | Use `mutateAsync` everywhere |
| `otpKeys.signup` used instead of `otpKeys.resetPassword` in verify | Corrected key |
| `setCache` storing bare string instead of full payload object | Store full `{email, otpHash, attempts}` |
| `Activity_actorId_fkey` FK violation on member delete | `onDelete: SetNull` + migration |
| `Issue.assignedTo/createdBy` FK violation on member delete | `onDelete: SetNull` + nullable fields |
| `Notification.memberId` FK violation on member delete | `onDelete: SetNull` |
| Prisma Client stale after schema change | `prisma generate` + container restart |
| `isOwnerOrAdmin` inverted logic (`MEMBER \|\| ADMIN`) | Corrected to `OWNER \|\| ADMIN` |
| Socket `handshake.auth.token` incompatible with httpOnly cookies | Parse cookies from `handshake.headers.cookie` |
| `useNotificationUnreadCount` spurious refetch on tab switch | `staleTime: Infinity` + `refetchOnWindowFocus: false` |
| `WorkspaceLayout.localStorage.setItem` on invalid slug | Only set when `workspaceSlug && workspace` both valid |
| Navigation freeze during lazy chunk download | `v7_startTransition: true` on `createBrowserRouter` |
| `workspaces.find()` operator precedence bug | `ws.slug === (workspaceSlug ?? lastSlug)` |
| `MemberCard` OWNER seeing own action menu | `!isCurrentUser && isOwnerOrAdmin` (proper parentheses) |